ts", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50529, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Va4U74aDBVEB33WDQ42uio", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50529, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Va4U74aDBVEB33WDQ42uio", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52626, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. No change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed. I retried once and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open for checkout-api. The first attempt to create it timed out, but it had been created, so I did not submit it again and nobody was paged twice. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01U62puPLTq5LF1K8LEyLke3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QHQvW1zUk9aNLq9ncQdSSq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_u